  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Naremiet BMU Fishing Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Fishing.Beneficiaries: Fishermen and women.Summary: The project funds will be used to build the capacity of Naremiet to manage an expansion of its fishing enterprise by providing training and productive assets. Training will focus on best practices in fishing and post-harvest hygiene; and the BMU&apos;s communal operations including financial management; book-keeping; and marketing. The grant will fund a boat; nets and equipment with which Naremiet will pilot increased fishing activities; and drying racks to improve the hygiene of the drying processes.</narrative>
  </description>
